# Reference artwork is a local design input only (see references/README.md) and is
# never redistributed. The directory itself is ignored except its README, and the
# loose-image rules below are anchored to the repository root so that a reference
# image dropped next to the sources cannot be committed by accident. They do not
# affect assets/, which holds the theme's own cover and screenshots.
references/*
!references/README.md
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
/*.gif

# Local working material written by the author, not project sources.
checkout-diff.md

# Configuration for the omp harness used on this machine (mode 0600).
.omp/
